Resource: Pot Vapor 02, identified with Structure_Vapor_Pot_02_Art from the
Chromatic Chaos VHS pack. Original creator: Polygonal Mind.
Canonical record: https://github.com/numengames/numinia-archive/blob/main/system/SYS-005-digital-resource-register.md#pot-vapor-02

The rightsholder's CC0 offer:
https://github.com/PolygonalMind/initiative-opensource-release#the-opensource-initiative

The GLB remains byte-identical to the reviewed CC0-labelled legacy original:
https://github.com/PabloFMM/numinia-digital-goods-data/blob/952a01987b2adefe305864956d59e8bf8cc9e5de/content/models/pot-vapor-02.glb

Three textures match the upstream exactly and the unique vertex-position
sets match after an axis conversion. This does not assert identical topology,
UVs or FBX/GLB binaries. The catalogue's PabloFMM credit is retained as a
historical credit, not asserted as original authorship. The converter's
identity is not independently established. See the canonical evidence record.
